# Campfire needs no secrets.
#
# There is no auth and no database: guest identity lives in the browser and
# station state is in-process. SoundCloud playback uses the public Widget API,
# which needs no API key. See research/ADR-003-PORTFOLIO-PIVOT.md.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local only if you want to override something, e.g.:
#   PORT=3001
